{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Monster Slayers in a world drowning in darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Echoes of Undeath</i> is a gothic, third-person survival action game inspired by classics like Castlevania \u2014 but with a fresh twist: survive endless waves of demons and undead, master brutal melee combat, and unlock forbidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack and slash hordes of skeletons, demons, and eldritch horrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield swords, axes, and devastating magical sigils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up to gain new spells and passive powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a relentless onslaught \u2014 how long can you survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric dark fantasy world with rich VFX and haunting music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned online co-op mode: slay together with friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Early Access Roadmap:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New weapons, maps, and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More spells and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full co-op mode and community-driven features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to face your nightmares. How long will you last before you join the legion of the undead?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770720?t=1751471848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770720?t=1751471848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770720/3f7c7ee2a1a1afba84983492545736020dd2f833/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751471848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770720/3f7c7ee2a1a1afba84983492545736020dd2